#: src/getting-started.md:609
msgid ""
"// Reconcile is part of the main kubernetes reconciliation loop which aims "
"to\n"
"// move the current state of the cluster closer to the desired state.\n"
"// It is essential for the controller's reconciliation loop to be "
"idempotent. By following the Operator\n"
"// pattern you will create Controllers which provide a reconcile function\n"
"// responsible for synchronizing resources until the desired state is "
"reached on the cluster.\n"
