#: src/migration/namespace-scoped.md:506
msgid ""
"**Only controllers need RBAC updates**: Only update `+kubebuilder:rbac` "
"markers in controller files (files with `Reconcile` function). Webhook files "
"do NOT use RBAC markers - webhooks use certificate-based authentication with "
"the API server."
