#: src/migration/namespace-scoped.md:507
msgid ""
"**RBAC markers control scope**: The `namespace=` parameter in controller "
"RBAC markers determines whether controller-gen generates `Role` "
"(namespace-scoped) or `ClusterRole` (cluster-scoped). Without the "
"`namespace=` parameter, controller-gen always generates `ClusterRole`."
msgstr ""

#: src/migration/namespace-scoped.md:508
msgid ""
"**Controller-gen regenerates role.yaml**: After running `make manifests`, "
"controller-gen will regenerate `config/rbac/role.yaml` based on your "
"controller RBAC markers. The initial `Role` scaffold from `kubebuilder edit "
"--namespaced=true` serves as a template, but controller-gen manages the "
"actual content."
msgstr ""

#: src/migration/namespace-scoped.md:509
msgid ""
"**Namespace parameter format**: Use `namespace=<your-namespace>` in "
"controller RBAC markers, typically `namespace=<project-name>-system` to "
"match your deployment namespace."
msgstr ""

#: src/migration/namespace-scoped.md:510
msgid ""
"**Metrics auth role stays cluster-scoped**: The `metrics-auth-role` uses "
"cluster-scoped APIs (TokenReview, SubjectAccessReview) and correctly remains "
"a ClusterRole without namespace parameter."
msgstr ""

#: src/migration/namespace-scoped.md:511
msgid ""
"**Webhooks require manual configuration**: Currently, controller-gen does "
"not support `namespaceSelector` or `objectSelector` markers for webhooks. "
"See the webhook section above for details."
msgstr ""

