#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:1
msgid "Update Your Project with (`alpha update`)"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:5
msgid ""
"`kubebuilder alpha update` upgrades your project’s scaffold to a newer "
"Kubebuilder release using a **3-way Git merge**. It rebuilds clean scaffolds "
"for the old and new versions, merges your current code into the new "
"scaffold, and gives you a reviewable output branch. It takes care of the "
"heavy lifting so you can focus on reviewing and resolving conflicts, not "
"re-applying your code."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:9
msgid ""
"By default, the final result is **squashed into a single commit** on a "
"dedicated output branch. If you prefer to keep the full history (no squash), "
"use `--show-commits`."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:15
msgid ""
"You can reduce the burden of keeping your project up to date by using the "
"[AutoUpdate Plugin](./../../plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) which "
"automates the process of running `kubebuilder alpha update` on a schedule "
"workflow when new Kubebuilder releases are available."
msgstr ""

