#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:32
msgid ""
"You tell the tool the **new version**, and which branch has your project. It "
"rebuilds both scaffolds, merges your code into the new one with a **3-way "
"merge**, and gives you an output branch you can review and merge safely. You "
"decide if you want one clean commit, the full history, or an auto-push to "
"remote."
msgstr ""

