msgstr ""

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:23
msgid ""
"`related` is an optional secondary object related to this event (use `nil` "
"if not applicable)."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:24
msgid ""
"`eventtype` is this event type, and is either _Normal_ or _Warning_. ([More "
"info](https://github.com/kubernetes/api/blob/6c11c9e4685cc62e4ddc8d4aaa824c46150c9148/core/v1/types.go#L6019-L6024))"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:25
msgid ""
"`reason` is the reason the controller generates this event. It should be "
"short and unique with `UpperCamelCase` format. The value could appear in "
"_switch_ statements by automation. ([More "
"info](https://github.com/kubernetes/api/blob/6c11c9e4685cc62e4ddc8d4aaa824c46150c9148/core/v1/types.go#L6048))"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:26
msgid "`action` is the action that was taken/failed regarding the object."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:27
msgid "`message` is a human-readable description with optional format arguments."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:34
