msgstr ""

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:54
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:115
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:474
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:535
msgid ""
"    // Basic field validation using self\n"
"    // +kubebuilder:validation:XValidation:rule=&#34;self.minReplicas &lt;= "
"self.replicas &amp;&amp; self.replicas &lt;= "
"self.maxReplicas&#34;,message=&#34;replicas must be between minReplicas and "
"maxReplicas&#34;\n"
"    \n"
"    // Validation with custom reason\n"
"    // +kubebuilder:validation:XValidation:rule=&#34;self.x &lt;= "
"self.maxX&#34;,message=&#34;x cannot be greater than "
"maxX&#34;,reason=&#34;FieldValueInvalid&#34;\n"
"    \n"
"    // Immutability check using oldSelf (e.g. on a field so self/oldSelf are "
"that field&#39;s value)\n"
"    // +kubebuilder:validation:XValidation:rule=&#34;self == "
"oldSelf&#34;,message=&#34;field is immutable&#34;\n"
"    \n"
"    // Validation with field path for better error reporting\n"
"    // +kubebuilder:validation:XValidation:rule=&#34;self &gt;= "
"1&#34;,message=&#34;value must be at least "
"1&#34;,fieldPath=&#34;.spec.replicas&#34;\n"
"    "
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:68
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:129
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:488
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:549
msgid "Example: FieldPath=\".spec.replicas\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:72
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:133
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:492
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:553
msgid ""
"If unset, the default is \"failed rule: {Rule}\". Must not contain line "
"breaks. The API server limits length (e.g. 256 characters). See "
"ValidationRule in k8s.io/apiextensions-apiserver for full details. Example: "
"Message=\"replicas must be between minReplicas and maxReplicas\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:79
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:140
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:499
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:560
msgid ""
"You can set Message or MessageExpression, not both. MessageExpression must "
"return a string. If both are set, MessageExpression is used. If neither is "
"set, a default message is used. The expression can use the same variables as "
"the Rule (e.g. self, oldSelf). The result must not contain line breaks and "
"is subject to the same message limits as Message. Example: "
"MessageExpression=\"'replicas must be between ' + string(self.minReplicas) + "
"' and ' + string(self.maxReplicas)\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:87
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:148
