#: src/reference/markers/applyconfiguration.md:3
msgid ""
"These markers control when ApplyConfiguration types are generated for the "
"kinds in a package. These types provide a type-safe way to build patches for "
"[Server-Side "
"Apply](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/using-api/server-side-apply/)."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/markers/applyconfiguration.md:7
msgid ""
