msgstr ""

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:21
msgid ""
"```golang\n"
"mgr, err := ctrl.NewManager(ctrl.GetConfigOrDie(), ctrl.Options{\n"
"  ...\n"
"  // PprofBindAddress is the TCP address that the controller should bind to\n"
"  // for serving pprof. Specify the manager address and the port that should "
"be bind.\n"
"  PprofBindAddress:       \":8082\",\n"
"  ...\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

