#: src/reference/envtest.md:101
msgid ""
"Therefore, you can check that the plugin generates a test using ENV TEST for "
"the controller which ensures that the controller creates the Deployment "
"successfully. You can see an example of its code implementation under the "
"`testdata` directory with the "
"[DeployImage](../plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) [samples "
