msgid ""
"If you are using Prometheus Operator, be aware that, by default, its RBAC "
"rules are only enabled for the `default` and `kube-system namespaces`. See "
"its guide to know [how to configure kube-prometheus to monitor other "
"namespaces using the `.jsonnet` "
"file](https://github.com/prometheus-operator/kube-prometheus/blob/main/docs/monitoring-other-namespaces.md)."
