"All projects that you scaffold with the CLI (KB version 3.0 and higher) "
"generate the `PROJECT` file in the projects' root directory. Therefore, it "
"stores all plugins and input data you used to generate the project and APIs "
"to better enable plugins to make useful decisions when scaffolding."
