"`true`. Provided via the `--external-api-module` flag to explicitly pin a "
"specific version in `go.mod` or to specify the module when it cannot be "
"automatically determined from `--external-api-path`. If not provided, `go "
"mod tidy` will resolve the dependency automatically."
