"It helps users deploy and manage an image (Operand) using the [Operator "
"pattern](https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/extend-kubernetes/operator/)."
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:50
msgid ""
"If you are looking for a quick and efficient way to set up a custom "
"controller and manage a container image, this plugin is a great choice."
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:54
msgid ""
"**Initialize your project**: After creating a new project with `kubebuilder "
"init`, you can use this plugin to create APIs. Ensure that you have "
"completed the [quick start](./../../quick-start.md) guide before proceeding."
