#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:59
msgid ""
"**Create APIs**: With this plugin, you can [create "
"APIs](../../cronjob-tutorial/new-api.md) to specify the image (Operand) you "
"want to deploy on the cluster. You can also optionally specify the command, "
